cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper (preferred-citation).
title: "GenPhysiCal / DECI-Net: reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the GenPhysiCal continuous model-calibration
  framework and the DECI-Net (Denoised-Encodings-Conditioned Invertible Neural
  Network) generative calibrator model for physics-based models in smart-building
  digital twins.
type: software
license: MIT
