  - family-names: Bitsuamlak
    given-names: Girma T.
    affiliation: "Department of Civil and Environmental Engineering / WindEEE Research Institute, Western University"
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - model calibration
  - building energy model
  - normalizing flows
  - conditional invertible neural network
  - uncertainty quantification

